&lt;p&gt;From: Harriet, To: Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Postcard Info: Leap Year Series No. 1062&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Normal, Illinois on July 27, 1908&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Ruby&lt;br&gt;
We miss the jolly bunch of girls which you helped to make.&lt;br&gt;
So long for now,&lt;br&gt;
Harriet&lt;/p&gt;</description>
